&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About 21shares&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;21shares makes investing in digital assets as easy as buying shares using your conventional broker or bank. Investors can purchase our crypto ETPs easily, safely and securely in a regulated framework on the SIX Swiss Exchange in USD, Euros and GBP, on BX Swiss in CHF, on Boerse Stuttgart in Euros, on DB Xetra as well as Wiener Boerse ( Vienna Exchange) in Euros. We offer the most expansive suite of crypto ETPs available on regulated European exchanges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2018, 21shares is led by a team of talented entrepreneurs and experienced professionals from the asset management and banking industry. Headquartered in Zurich, the company has launched several exchange-traded products such as NEAR and ONDO in the last twelve months.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Basic Information &amp;amp; Requisition Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title:&lt;/strong&gt; Front-Office Data Support Analyst&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Capital Markets &amp;amp; Trading&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seniority / Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Intern&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Internship - 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London, UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target Start Date:&lt;/strong&gt; ASAP&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit on the front-office trading desk at the centre of 21shares&#39; ETF/ETP business, with direct, ongoing exposure to how the firm&#39;s data, products, and market activity connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across three lenses on the desk&#39;s data: research (sourcing and structuring), reconciliation (validating accuracy against source systems), and performance (tracking and reporting on product and market activity), building and maintaining the underlying infrastructure via API and internal databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently identify gaps in data coverage or reporting and take ownership of resolving them, rather than working purely to a fixed task list&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with product, research, and legal teams, translating data into outputs used both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain in-depth knowledge in crypto , trading, research, operations and lifecycle of an asset manager in addition to deep knowledge on data analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and validate daily data feeds (NAV, AUM, flows, holdings, staking rewards, index values etc) across the internal database and third-party APIs, flagging discrepancies before they start affecting the product&#39;s health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the link between the trading desk and the data/engineering team, translating desk requirements into technical specs and communicating data/system constraints back to trading and product stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify manual or spreadsheet-based reporting workflows and replace them with Python/SQL scripts/Claude dashboards to reduce turnaround time and error rate as well as document the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External data validation:&lt;/strong&gt; Support QA of data published to external channels (website, product pages, factsheets) to ensure consistency with the internal source of truth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ad hoc requests: &lt;/strong&gt;Handle ad hoc data requests from product development, risk, distribution teams etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Qualifications &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor or Master’s degree in Quantitative Finance, Mathematics, Engineering, Economics, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
