&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in financial markets and curiosity to learn more on risk management, market dynamics, blockchain and DeFi&amp;nbsp; concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and quantitative skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and cross-team collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined self-starter with a high degree of rigor and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You like to challenge and be challenged to get the best solutions to a problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications / Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with financial products like ETPs and ETFs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with technical and development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of database systems (PostgreSQL or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
